WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:02.935
-Welcome back to "Late Night."
We're here with Tracy Morgan.

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.004
You got a giant honor recently.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.304
You were honored by
the Friars Club

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.507
as their Icon,
their Icon Award?

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.008
This has been given out to
people like

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:12.144
Billy Crystal, Martin Scorsese,
Robert de Niro, Tony Bennett.

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:13.513
Quite a list.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.780
-Yeah, man.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.982
Douglas Fairbanks Jr.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.416
They weren't even talking
back then.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.918
-Yeah.
-And I got one.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.455
I'm like, y'all sure y'all
giving it to the right person?

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:23.756
They gave me a Friars Club --

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.726
I'm the first black recipient
to get this award.

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.761
[ Cheers and applause ]
-That's fantastic.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.364
-First Black recipient.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.999
Think about that.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.535
You think about that,
the first Black recipient

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.438
to receive an Icon
Friars Club Award.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.806
So we can look back on this
and say,

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:43.910
I am the first, like,
Friars Club member

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.678
to have a bigger [bleep]
than Milton Berle.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.715
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.318
-That is what I'm gonna say
when I look back on it.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.320
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.821
-Very important.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.556
-It's historic.

00:00:57.556 --> 00:00:59.392
Now -- [ Laughing ]

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.394
Hey, I know there were
a lot of people there

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.830
to celebrate you, including
our new mayor, Mayor Adams,

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.532
who tends to get out to events.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:09.702
-Yeah, he was there.
Giuliani was there.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.338
De Blasio,
everybody was there, man.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.073
The mayor was there.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:16.276
I don't call him "Mayor Adams."
I call him "Eric."

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.843
-You call him Eric?
-That's my boy, yeah.

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.179
We went to high school together.
-You did? How was that?

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:23.015
-I sold him lunch tickets.
-You sold him lunch tickets?

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:24.984
-Especially when it was
fish and tater tots.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.285
-[ Laughing ]

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.087
-He loved tater tots
and chocolate milk.

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:29.355
[ Laughing ]

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.657
-You were kind enough to
sell him your lunch ticket.

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:32.858
-Yeah, I love the mayor.

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:34.627
-That's great.
-That's my guy.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.495
-I'm very happy to hear that.
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:38.197
-I want to ask about this.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:41.934
Your daughter has taken to
the idea of doing stand-up.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.169
-Yeah, that's my baby.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.938
She just did it in front of
Radio City,

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.672
three jokes and told a story

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:50.243
in front of 500 people
at Radio City, and it was great.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.745
She writes my material now.
-She writes your material?

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.013
-Yeah.
-What does she got?

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.615
She got anything you like?
-A lot of good stuff.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:58.250
Like, the other day, she was
playing with her cousin,

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.319
and they were playing with
the Tonka Trucks,

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:02.889
and her cousin accidentally
hit her with a Tonka truck,

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:05.358
and she made him pay her $20.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.893
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:08.528
I said, "You're a chip
off the old block."

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:10.129
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:13.833
-Hey, is it true --
we have Jabari Banks coming out.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:17.169
He's so great in the new
"Bel-Air," playing --

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:18.404
-I don't like to talk
about that.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.840
-Okay, 'cause you don't
like to talk about --

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.941
-Nah, I could have
got that role.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.075
-Oh.
-Yeah.

00:02:23.075 --> 00:02:24.277
[ Laughter ]
I could have got that role.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:26.212
They did a background check.
Too much porno.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.013
-Oh, really?

00:02:28.013 --> 00:02:29.682
-I starred in too much
porno stuff.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:32.151
-So it wasn't that you were
too old for the part,

00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:33.886
it was just, you failed
the background check?

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:35.387
-Yeah, the background check.
-Yeah.

00:02:35.387 --> 00:02:37.390
-That's such a bummer.
-I had the part!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.924
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:41.327
-They gave you the cast,
and then they did

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.695
the background check
and they took it away.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.664
-Too much. No.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:47.233
-That's so heartbreaking.
I'm so sorry.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.969
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:52.805
Hey, what's the title,
"No Disrespect,"

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:54.040
how'd you come up with the title
for your show?

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.908
-'Cause I'mma say
a lot of stuff onstage,

00:02:55.908 --> 00:02:57.510
and I don't mean to
disrespect anybody.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.044
-Okay, so you'd like to
get that out front.

00:02:59.044 --> 00:03:01.146
-There's a lot going on.
-Yeah, there's a lot going on.

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:03.315
-Between audience members
and comedians on there.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:04.517
-Yeah.
-There's a lot going on now.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.886
That's why I bring
a baseball bat onstage.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.054
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:11.023
-I got a Louisville Slugger
for you.

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:13.693
This is not "attack
Tracy Morgan onstage" night.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:16.696
-You've got a lot of shows
in Texas.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.130
I think four or five dates
in Texas.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.599
Have you done stand-up
in Texas before?

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.234
-Yeah, I've done it there, but
this is on a different level,

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:25.204
because of the recent
mass shooting there, man.

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:28.307
I just want to go there and show
some love to those people, man.

00:03:28.307 --> 00:03:30.943
[ Applause ]
-That's really sweet.

00:03:30.943 --> 00:03:33.880
-I love you, Texas.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.514
It was horrible.

00:03:35.514 --> 00:03:38.517
It was a horrible thing, and we
were all traumatized by it.

00:03:38.517 --> 00:03:40.819
I just want to have
an opportunity to go there

00:03:40.819 --> 00:03:42.387
and show my love
to those people.

00:03:42.387 --> 00:03:46.592
-And I imagine when people go
and see Tracy Morgan,

00:03:46.592 --> 00:03:48.894
the expectation is they're gonna
have a really good time,

00:03:48.894 --> 00:03:50.796
and I can't imagine you'd do
anything but deliver.

00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:52.098
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.332
-Well, thank you so much
for being here, Tracy.

00:03:53.332 --> 00:03:54.400
-I love you, Seth.
You know that.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.734
-It's always an honor
to have you here.

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:57.870
-You guys, that's Tracy Morgan.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.006
For tickets and information
about the "No Disrespect" tour,

00:04:01.006 --> 00:04:05.277
which heads to Texas next month,
July 21st through the 24th,

00:04:05.277 --> 00:04:06.712
you can go to TracyMorgan.com.

00:04:06.712 --> 00:04:08.548
We'll be right back
with Jabari Banks.

